        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Anikin Labs · MOSS-Image-SFT BF16\n\n## 1. Main Model · Quality + Turbo\n[moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n\n## 2. Text Encoder · Qwen 3.5\n[qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## 3. VAE · FLUX.2\n[flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n## 4. Turbo LoRA · akhaliq 4-step v2.0\n[moss_image_sft_4step_v2.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/akhaliq/MOSS-Image-SFT-4-steps/resolve/main/moss_image_sft_4step_v2.0.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/loras/`\n\n## 5. Required Custom Nodes\n[rgthree-comfy · Fast Groups Muter](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)  \n→ `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/rgthree-comfy/`  \nAlternatively, install **rgthree-comfy** using ComfyUI Manager.\n\nUpdate [ComfyUI](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI). The **Load CLIP** node must support the `moss_image` type.\n\n## How to Use\n**A · QUALITY:** 50 steps · CFG 3 · Euler / sgm_uniform  \n**B · TURBO:** 4 steps · CFG 1 · Euler / simple\n\nEnter your own **Positive Prompt**. The Negative Prompt is used in Quality mode; in Turbo mode with CFG 1, it has no effect on the result.  \nThe three optional LoRA loaders are **bypassed by default**. Enable them only when you have installed compatible LoRAs in `ComfyUI/models/loras/`.\n\nAfter downloading and installing the required files, **restart ComfyUI**.\n\n**Workflow by Anikin Labs**"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Anikin Labs · MOSS-Image-SFT BF16\n\n## 1. Main Model · Quality + Turbo\n[moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n\n## 2. Text Encoder · Qwen 3.5\n[qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## 3. VAE · FLUX.2\n[flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n## 4. Turbo LoRA · akhaliq 4-step v2.0\n[moss_image_sft_4step_v2.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/akhaliq/MOSS-Image-SFT-4-steps/resolve/main/moss_image_sft_4step_v2.0.safetensors)  \n→ `ComfyUI/models/loras/`\n\n## 5. Required Custom Nodes\n[rgthree-comfy · Fast Groups Muter](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)  \n→ `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/rgthree-comfy/`  \nAlternatively, install **rgthree-comfy** using ComfyUI Manager.\n\nUpdate [ComfyUI](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI). The **Load CLIP** node must support the `moss_image` type.\n\n## How to Use\n**A · QUALITY:** 50 steps · CFG 3 · Euler / sgm_uniform  \n**B · TURBO:** 4 steps · CFG 1 · Euler / simple\n\nEnter your own **Positive Prompt**. The Negative Prompt is used in Quality mode; in Turbo mode with CFG 1, it has no effect on the result.  \nThe three optional LoRA loaders are **bypassed by default**. Enable them only when you have installed compatible LoRAs in `ComfyUI/models/loras/`.\n\nAfter downloading and installing the required files, **restart ComfyUI**.\n\n**Workflow by Anikin Labs**"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
